&lt;p&gt;    Also after making API return OK, `./grunt serve` stops working, guess this would be this reason. &lt;a href=&quot;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/233507/how-to-log-out-user-from-web-site-using-basic-authentication/233551#233551&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://stackoverflow.com/questions/233507/how-to-log-out-user-from-web-site-using-basic-authentication/233551#233551&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
